{"id": "EUVD-2026-77169", "enisaUuid": "3939494c-48f5-3c92-a534-e02f17779605", "description": "A weakness has been identified in FedML-AI FedML up to 0.9.6. Affected by this issue is the function S3Storage.read_model of the file fedml/core/distributed/communication/s3/remote_storage.py of the component MQTT+S3 Communication Backend. This manipulation of the argument s3_key_str causes deserialization. Remote exploitation of the attack is possible. The project was informed of the problem early through an issue report but has not responded yet.", "datePublished": "2026-09-14T01:45:10", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-14T15:01:55", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:L/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N/E:X", "references": ["https://vuldb.com/vuln/403196", "https://vuldb.com/vuln/403196/cti", "https://vuldb.com/cve/CVE-2026-90614", "https://vuldb.com/submit/914219", "https://github.com/FedML-AI/FedML/issues/2267", "https://github.com/FedML-AI/FedML/"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-90614", "GHSA-96qh-x5p5-9v7x"], "assigner": "VulDB", "epss": 0.43, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "00cf77fc-1985-3691-9538-6671ec4648df", "product": {"name": "FedML", "vendor": {"name": "FedML-AI"}}, "product_version": "0.9.1"}, {"id": "2578c2b2-e3eb-3867-9d62-1ea939d32aa7", "product": {"name": "FedML", "vendor": {"name": "FedML-AI"}}, "product_version": "0.9.0"}, {"id": "4f0a4178-4177-3e39-bd4f-6e0190347cc8", "product": {"name": "FedML", "vendor": {"name": "FedML-AI"}}, "product_version": "0.9.5"}, {"id": "a87c7a8c-c90c-3fe4-b954-d980b317b58d", "product": {"name": "FedML", "vendor": {"name": "FedML-AI"}}, "product_version": "0.9.6"}, {"id": "ac255b7a-0c41-3898-bbd2-aefa7bfe5315", "product": {"name": "FedML", "vendor": {"name": "FedML-AI"}}, "product_version": "0.9.2"}, {"id": "bc98210d-b8ca-3966-a920-37f66f3dee09", "product": {"name": "FedML", "vendor": {"name": "FedML-AI"}}, "product_version": "0.9.4"}, {"id": "fead065a-37b5-36ea-9b40-ac275afe1e18", "produ